WEBVTT

00:02.589 --> 00:06.513
BRITANNIA REPUBLIC

00:06.597 --> 00:08.601
[people screaming]

00:17.994 --> 00:20.082
[both grunt, gasp]

00:23.631 --> 00:25.384
[radar soldier] <i>Loki transport vessel
in sight.</i>

00:25.467 --> 00:26.553
[captain] <i>Prepare torpedoes.</i>

00:32.231 --> 00:34.026
[radar soldier] <i>Fifty Loki approaching.</i>

00:34.110 --> 00:35.320
[captain] <i>Launch torpedoes!</i>

00:35.404 --> 00:36.615
[soldier 1] <i>Launching torpedoes!</i>

00:44.338 --> 00:45.925
[radar soldier] <i>Detonation confirmed.</i>

00:46.009 --> 00:47.469
<i>Countless Loki remaining.</i>

00:47.554 --> 00:50.475
[captain] <i>They're preventing us
from taking out the transport vessel...</i>

00:50.560 --> 00:52.313
TOKYO

01:02.041 --> 01:04.253
I won't stand by
and let some machines kill humans!

01:04.755 --> 01:05.757
LONDON

01:05.840 --> 01:07.719
[operator] <i>Worldwide, the Loki invasion
is spreading</i>

01:07.802 --> 01:09.138
<i>from coastal areas to inland regions.</i>

01:09.221 --> 01:10.223
[Gino] <i>This is bad.</i>

01:10.307 --> 01:12.102
<i>Reassess our defense line.</i>

01:13.063 --> 01:15.818
[Cornelia] <i>How long can we hold out
with our current forces?</i>

01:16.612 --> 01:19.785
[operator] <i>It varies by region,
but according to our estimates,</i>

01:19.868 --> 01:22.540
<i>all our Knightmare Frames
will be wiped out in three days.</i>

01:22.999 --> 01:25.588
[Cornelia] <i>So, we have
no chance of winning.</i>

01:25.672 --> 01:27.091
[Gino] <i>Wait.</i>

01:27.174 --> 01:30.013
<i>I cannot accept that the world
could be destroyed</i>

01:30.097 --> 01:31.474
<i>due to one man's scheming.</i>

01:31.558 --> 01:32.560
WAIKIKI

01:32.644 --> 01:34.355
[Cornelia] <i>I completely agree.</i>

01:35.148 --> 01:38.196
But there's no end to them.

01:38.864 --> 01:41.035
[Gino] <i>Damn Loki... They just keep coming.</i>

01:41.119 --> 01:42.872
<i>The way it's looking,</i>

01:42.956 --> 01:45.962
we'll need to defeat Norland
and stop these things quickly,

01:46.045 --> 01:49.135
<i>or humanity will be wiped off
the face of the earth.</i>

01:51.472 --> 01:54.353
[Norland] <i>The earth is being purified.</i>

01:56.065 --> 01:58.361
<i>How satisfying.</i>

01:59.614 --> 02:02.035
<i>I will savor</i>

02:02.119 --> 02:04.498
<i>this moment of bliss...</i>

02:06.043 --> 02:08.006
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:43.906 --> 03:44.908
[meows]

03:44.991 --> 03:45.993
[Gino] <i>All right.</i>

03:46.077 --> 03:47.496
<i>Start in 30 minutes.</i>

03:47.580 --> 03:48.874
UNITED FEDERATION OF NATIONS HQ

03:49.416 --> 03:53.634
Chairwoman Kaguya, your statement will be
delivered in the main conference room.

03:54.134 --> 03:55.470
Very well.

03:57.140 --> 03:59.646
[wind whistling]

04:01.900 --> 04:04.531
[alarms blaring]

04:19.519 --> 04:20.563
[Ash] <i>Nothing's changed.</i>

04:22.065 --> 04:23.276
<i>I'm still...</i>

04:25.363 --> 04:27.409
<i>in the palm of his hand...</i>

04:32.837 --> 04:33.839
[gasps]

04:36.052 --> 04:37.053
Ash!

04:45.905 --> 04:46.907
Are you okay?!

04:47.575 --> 04:48.577
Hey!

04:48.660 --> 04:50.664
[Rozé] <i>Ash, can you hear me?!</i>

04:51.040 --> 04:52.084
<i>Ash!</i>

05:01.645 --> 05:03.816
[alarm trills]

05:04.943 --> 05:06.195
[Norland chuckles]

05:06.947 --> 05:09.661
[Norland] <i>It's too late
to change anything now.</i>

05:15.923 --> 05:17.133
-[button beeps]
-[mechanical whir]

05:20.223 --> 05:22.394
[Rozé] Ash, are you okay?

05:23.564 --> 05:24.774
Yeah...

05:25.441 --> 05:26.653
[Ash] I'm fine.

05:27.487 --> 05:29.576
[Rozé] If the Apollo isn't working,

05:29.659 --> 05:31.746
-I'll fight him with the Artemis--
-No.

05:31.830 --> 05:33.709
I can't let you go.

05:34.168 --> 05:35.963
Because of your promise to my father?

05:36.046 --> 05:38.092
[♪ melancholic music playing]

05:38.176 --> 05:41.056
You've protected me enough.

05:41.140 --> 05:42.560
Now I want to protect you...

05:42.643 --> 05:45.858
Not just you. I want to protect everyone.

05:47.862 --> 05:51.201
All this time,
I've been fighting to save Sakura.

05:52.830 --> 05:56.963
[Rozé] <i>I thought I possessed
the power and resolve to do it.</i>

05:57.673 --> 06:02.600
<i>But I misjudged how to use this power.</i>

06:03.184 --> 06:08.110
<i>And my arrogance resulted
in the loss of many lives.</i>

06:09.029 --> 06:11.576
<i>I didn't realize</i>

06:11.660 --> 06:14.331
that I was being protected all along.

06:15.584 --> 06:20.552
So this time, I'll take responsibility
for the fight I started

06:20.636 --> 06:22.222
and protect everyone.

06:23.642 --> 06:25.103
[Rozé] Starting with you, Ash.

06:26.272 --> 06:28.527
Let me protect you.

06:37.168 --> 06:38.505
[Ash] <i>I see...</i>

06:39.882 --> 06:41.553
<i>All this time, I...</i>

06:43.807 --> 06:44.851
I have a request.

06:46.020 --> 06:48.274
Use your Geass on me again.

06:50.028 --> 06:51.280
What're you talking abo--

06:51.363 --> 06:54.202
Arnold removed the Geass you put on me.

06:54.704 --> 06:56.666
Can you use it on me again?

06:57.668 --> 06:58.962
Well...

06:59.964 --> 07:01.801
Maybe, but...

07:03.012 --> 07:05.976
I never want to use my Geass on you again.

07:06.060 --> 07:08.523
[Rozé] I don't want to control you
with this power--

07:08.607 --> 07:10.193
Right now, it's necessary.

07:11.613 --> 07:14.159
You can't defeat Norland.

07:15.453 --> 07:19.712
[Ash] And... I couldn't defeat him
on my own either.

07:21.423 --> 07:23.845
Nichol... Mr. Jugo...

07:24.847 --> 07:27.268
I couldn't protect them back then.

07:29.607 --> 07:31.026
I feel the same as you.

07:31.986 --> 07:35.661
I want to become someone
who can protect others.

07:36.996 --> 07:39.669
I'm prepared to sacrifice myself for that.

07:41.255 --> 07:46.933
If you're prepared to end this battle,
then bear the full weight of that resolve.

07:47.560 --> 07:50.356
[Rozé] And that means
using my Geass on you?

07:51.358 --> 07:52.360
Yes.

07:52.443 --> 07:54.030
[Rozé] The power of my Geass

07:54.114 --> 07:59.207
can rewrite your will, your beliefs,
even your memories.

07:59.959 --> 08:01.546
-Are you really--
-I don't care.

08:01.629 --> 08:07.641
[Rozé] If I use my Geass on you, you may
never be the same Ash Phoenix again...

08:09.060 --> 08:10.313
[Ash] So be it.

08:12.275 --> 08:14.530
You would bear the curse
of my Geass for life...

08:14.614 --> 08:15.616
[Ash] No.

08:18.078 --> 08:19.414
It's not a curse.

08:21.628 --> 08:23.297
It's a vow!

08:24.299 --> 08:26.554
I will shoulder your responsibility.

08:26.638 --> 08:30.102
So in return,
I ask you to shoulder my resolve.

08:31.648 --> 08:35.446
Sakuya Sumeragi, fight with me to the end!

08:48.974 --> 08:50.936
I, Sakuya Sumeragi, command you.

08:51.019 --> 08:52.815
Ash Phoenix.

08:52.898 --> 08:57.073
You will fight alongside me
as my knight against Norland.

08:57.658 --> 09:01.541
And you will win at all costs
to protect the world!

09:13.063 --> 09:15.151
Yes, Your Majesty.

09:19.952 --> 09:23.083
[Kaguya] <i>We are currently facing
an unprecedented threat.</i>

09:23.167 --> 09:24.461
UNITED FEDERATION OF NATIONS HQ

09:25.296 --> 09:30.097
Already, tens of thousands, if not
hundreds of thousands, have fallen victim.

09:30.181 --> 09:33.437
It goes without saying that we,
as the United Federation of Nations,

09:33.521 --> 09:36.109
cannot allow this to continue.

09:36.736 --> 09:40.117
[Kaguya] <i>The weapons attacking people
across the world are called Loki.</i>

09:40.201 --> 09:41.203
COLOGNE

09:41.286 --> 09:45.461
<i>The mastermind behind their production,
and the sole individual controlling them,</i>

09:45.545 --> 09:47.674
<i>is Norland von Lunebelg.</i>

09:48.593 --> 09:50.764
<i>There is only one way to stop the Loki.</i>

09:51.264 --> 09:55.439
<i>We must defeat Norland's
Knightmare Frame, the Foulbout,</i>

09:55.524 --> 09:57.485
<i>to which they are linked and synchronized.</i>

09:58.070 --> 10:01.702
<i>Preparations to counter Norland
are underway.</i>

10:02.663 --> 10:06.002
<i>Everyone, please do your utmost to survive</i>

10:06.086 --> 10:08.550
until we see this battle
through to the end.

10:10.344 --> 10:12.683
[Sakuya] <i>Energy sharing
with the Artemis complete.</i>

10:12.766 --> 10:15.146
[Ash] <i>Roger that. Initiating reboot.</i>

10:17.442 --> 10:19.780
[Knightmare powering up]

10:20.991 --> 10:22.243
[Ash] Reboot successful.

10:23.078 --> 10:24.665
[Sakuya] Docking now.

10:24.749 --> 10:25.750
[Ash] Roger that.

10:26.502 --> 10:27.462
Engage.

10:44.622 --> 10:46.626
[alarms trilling]

10:51.134 --> 10:52.596
[Norland scoffs]

10:53.013 --> 10:55.685
[Norland] <i>You just
keep coming back for more.</i>

11:05.454 --> 11:08.460
[Sakuya] <i>Ash, switch comms to secret mode.</i>

11:08.545 --> 11:10.214
-[Ash] <i>Roger that.</i>
-[comms trill]

11:10.297 --> 11:11.592
<i>Mode change complete.</i>

11:11.676 --> 11:15.642
[Sakuya] <i>So, the Foulbout is equipped with
the same system as the Situmpe Barrier?</i>

11:15.725 --> 11:19.148
[Ash] <i>Yes, and it's equipped with
at least ten cannons.</i>

11:19.232 --> 11:20.359
[Sakuya] <i>Ten...</i>

11:20.442 --> 11:23.282
<i>First, we'll need to confirm
their locations.</i>

11:23.407 --> 11:25.286
[Ash] <i>I have a certain pattern
to my movements</i>

11:25.369 --> 11:26.581
<i>which Norland can read.</i>

11:26.664 --> 11:29.628
[Sakuya] <i>I'll send you
a separate movement pattern,</i>

11:29.712 --> 11:31.381
<i>so just trace those movements.</i>

11:31.464 --> 11:32.634
[Ash] <i>Roger that.</i>

11:33.176 --> 11:36.391
I'm entrusting you
with piloting the Ortygia.

11:36.474 --> 11:37.476
Received.

11:37.561 --> 11:40.149
I'll need your help navigating
until we have enough data.

11:40.232 --> 11:41.234
[Sakuya] <i>Roger that.</i>

11:49.459 --> 11:50.461
[Ash] <i>Next.</i>

11:51.171 --> 11:52.173
[Sakuya] <i>Understood.</i>

11:53.801 --> 11:56.181
[Norland] <i>Has the pilot changed?</i>

11:56.264 --> 12:00.607
<i>No, Ash's movement patterns remain.</i>

12:00.690 --> 12:03.655
<i>Then is someone navigating him?</i>

12:04.155 --> 12:05.157
[Sakuya] <i>Ash.</i>

12:05.533 --> 12:08.038
I've gathered enough data.
Fall back for now.

12:08.121 --> 12:09.123
[Ash] <i>Roger that.</i>

12:09.583 --> 12:14.050
[Sakuya] <i>It has 14 cannons in total,
with almost no blind spots.</i>

12:14.425 --> 12:17.139
It seems only two cannons
can be fired simultaneously.

12:17.223 --> 12:20.396
Then we can dodge them from any position.

12:20.479 --> 12:25.573
[Sakuya] <i>The problem is that our weapons
can't deal damage without getting close.</i>

12:25.657 --> 12:28.663
[Ash] <i>Should we test how close we can get?</i>

12:28.746 --> 12:29.748
[Sakuya] <i>Good idea.</i>

12:29.832 --> 12:30.834
[Ash] <i>Navigate for me again.</i>

12:30.917 --> 12:31.877
[Sakuya] <i>Roger that.</i>

12:43.483 --> 12:45.195
[Ash] <i>Are you all right, Princess Sakuya?</i>

12:46.239 --> 12:48.285
-[alarm blaring]
-Princess Sakuya...?

12:48.368 --> 12:49.830
[Ash] <i>Sakuya, are you okay?!</i>

12:51.792 --> 12:52.794
[groans weakly]

12:53.921 --> 12:56.719
[Sakuya] <i>I'm sorry!
I lost consciousness...</i>

13:04.442 --> 13:06.572
-[panting heavily]
-[alarms blaring]

13:11.206 --> 13:12.208
[Sakuya] <i>I'm scared...</i>

13:13.418 --> 13:15.422
I don't think we can beat him...

13:15.507 --> 13:16.926
[Ash] <i>Don't give in to fear!</i>

13:17.468 --> 13:18.721
We will not lose!

13:18.888 --> 13:20.683
[♪ upbeat rock music playing]

13:21.059 --> 13:22.604
[Ash] <i>What did we learn just now?</i>

13:23.063 --> 13:26.194
[Sakuya] <i>That the Foulbout responds
incredibly fast to our movements.</i>

13:26.695 --> 13:28.448
<i>Either its performance is off the charts,</i>

13:28.533 --> 13:33.041
<i>or he's controlling the Knightmare Frame
by thought alone, without manual input.</i>

13:33.125 --> 13:36.256
If that's the case,
we can increase our response speed.

13:36.339 --> 13:40.974
[Sakuya] <i>Hey, what if we can cut off
the Foulbout's information input?</i>

13:41.057 --> 13:43.521
<i>Wouldn't that create
an opening for our attacks?</i>

13:43.604 --> 13:44.606
[Ash] <i>It's possible.</i>

13:45.148 --> 13:47.111
Calculating based on Sakuradite standards,

13:47.194 --> 13:49.908
if we can get the Foulbout
to fire continuously for 60 seconds,

13:49.992 --> 13:51.327
it won't be able to keep firing.

13:51.912 --> 13:54.668
[Ash] Allowing us to engage
in close combat.

13:55.252 --> 13:58.216
<i>Switching the Ortygia to Megistus Z Mode.</i>

13:58.300 --> 13:59.302
[Sakuya] <i>Roger!</i>

14:03.853 --> 14:04.938
[Norland] <i>Oh?</i>

14:05.523 --> 14:07.318
<i>Looks like they're up to something.</i>

14:10.324 --> 14:11.451
[Ash] <i>What about night vision?</i>

14:12.036 --> 14:13.038
[Sakuya] Not needed.

14:13.121 --> 14:14.123
[Ash] <i>Roger that.</i>

14:14.875 --> 14:17.254
Requesting navigation
and a countdown every 10 seconds.

14:17.338 --> 14:18.340
[Sakuya] <i>Roger that.</i>

14:19.676 --> 14:20.970
[Ash] <i>This time...</i>

14:22.557 --> 14:24.686
[Sakuya] <i>Countdown in three.</i>

14:24.770 --> 14:27.651
<i>Two. One. Start.</i>

14:31.992 --> 14:32.994
[Ash] Next.

14:36.961 --> 14:38.380
Fifty seconds left!

14:45.770 --> 14:46.772
[Ash] Next.

14:48.901 --> 14:50.070
[Sakuya] Forty seconds left!

14:51.740 --> 14:52.784
[Ash] <i>Next.</i>

15:00.382 --> 15:01.802
[Sakuya] <i>Thirty seconds left!</i>

15:07.438 --> 15:08.440
[Ash] Next.

15:11.320 --> 15:12.699
Twenty seconds left!

15:14.619 --> 15:15.621
[Ash] <i>Next.</i>

15:22.009 --> 15:23.011
[Sakuya] <i>Ten seconds left!</i>

15:23.554 --> 15:26.267
<i>Nine. Eight. Seven.</i>

15:26.350 --> 15:29.190
<i>Six. Five. Four.</i>

15:29.273 --> 15:31.820
<i>Three. Two. One.</i>

15:32.404 --> 15:33.741
[Ash] <i>What's its firing rate?</i>

15:33.824 --> 15:35.494
Down 47%!

15:35.578 --> 15:36.663
[Ash] <i>Nearly there.</i>

15:40.087 --> 15:42.675
Firing rate down 50%!

15:42.759 --> 15:43.803
Now.

15:45.222 --> 15:47.059
[Ash] <i>Checkmate!</i>

15:54.115 --> 15:55.367
[Norland] <i>A suicide attack?</i>

15:57.789 --> 15:59.041
<i>How foolish...</i>

16:04.553 --> 16:05.555
<i>A fake out!</i>

16:08.644 --> 16:10.438
-[Norland grunts]
-[electricity crackling]

16:13.319 --> 16:14.823
[metal grinding]

16:15.365 --> 16:16.367
[grunts]

16:19.541 --> 16:21.545
[rain pattering]

16:31.773 --> 16:32.775
[inaudible]

16:37.744 --> 16:38.746
-[clangs]
-[grunts]

16:41.375 --> 16:43.505
-[electricity crackling]
-[alarm blaring]

16:47.931 --> 16:50.393
-[Knightmare powers down]
-[ticking]

16:55.738 --> 16:56.740
[Ash] <i>It's over.</i>

16:57.115 --> 17:00.706
Did we really... defeat Norland?

17:01.750 --> 17:02.752
We did.

17:04.296 --> 17:05.758
[beeping]

17:11.812 --> 17:13.941
Huh? Ash?

17:14.483 --> 17:16.320
[Ash] <i>If we continue sharing energy,</i>

17:16.404 --> 17:18.534
<i>neither of us
will make it back to the surface.</i>

17:18.617 --> 17:20.913
<i>You still have work to do.</i>

17:20.997 --> 17:23.376
-[Sakuya] <i>But--
-</i> [Ash] <i>Norland is a proud man.</i>

17:24.169 --> 17:26.675
<i>He will erase all trace
of himself and his failure.</i>

17:28.219 --> 17:32.102
<i>I can't bear to see you
being dragged into that.</i>

17:32.185 --> 17:34.607
-[Sakuya] <i>But then you'll...
-</i> [Ash] <i>It's okay.</i>

17:35.651 --> 17:37.070
<i>It's for the best.</i>

17:40.619 --> 17:43.082
[Ash's breath trembles]

17:43.166 --> 17:44.293
<i>I get it now...</i>

17:45.003 --> 17:47.215
<i>I understand how Mr. Jugo felt.</i>

17:48.927 --> 17:51.600
<i>I'm not afraid to die...</i>

17:53.144 --> 17:55.941
but it hurts to think
I'll never see you again.

17:57.277 --> 17:59.866
[Ash] <i>It hurts... so much...</i>

18:06.630 --> 18:08.634
[inaudible]

18:13.142 --> 18:14.144
[wails]

18:38.401 --> 18:40.029
[boy 1] Come on! Another adventure awaits!

18:40.113 --> 18:42.033
-[boy 2] I wanna be the hero today!
-[Narah] Hey.

18:42.117 --> 18:43.746
-Don't go too far.
-[boy 1] No, I'm the hero!

18:43.829 --> 18:46.125
-[boy 2] You were the hero yesterday!
-[Catherine] Excuse me...

18:46.208 --> 18:47.210
[girl] Hey, wait up!

18:47.294 --> 18:49.924
Think you might have a job for me here?

18:51.887 --> 18:53.264
Let's talk.

18:53.347 --> 18:54.559
Yay!

18:55.185 --> 18:57.189
[birds chirping]

19:00.028 --> 19:04.537
Several months have passed since that day
when so many lives were lost.

19:04.954 --> 19:09.129
Efforts to recover from the devastation
inflicted by the Loki continue worldwide.

19:10.131 --> 19:12.344
[Kaguya] <i>We must never forget
this tragedy,</i>

19:12.427 --> 19:16.937
<i>nor the two Nameless Mercenaries
who protected our future,</i>

19:17.020 --> 19:20.443
<i>and we must cherish
the peace they secured.</i>

19:21.362 --> 19:24.619
Today, as a symbol of that peace,

19:24.702 --> 19:28.292
the Hokkaido Block will be designated
a Special Autonomous Region

19:28.376 --> 19:31.006
under the jurisdiction
of the United Federation of Nations.

19:32.133 --> 19:34.346
Working hand-in-hand
with Sakuya Sumeragi...

19:34.429 --> 19:37.435
This tentatively wraps up
the post-war settlement.

19:37.520 --> 19:39.524
Politically, at least...

19:39.607 --> 19:40.818
[sighs]

19:40.901 --> 19:44.366
And now, we're left to continue
carrying out the global cleanup.

19:44.449 --> 19:48.124
As Black Knights, that's part of our role.

19:48.834 --> 19:50.253
[Gino] <i>Indeed.</i>

19:53.802 --> 19:55.263
Second-Lieutenant Sakai, reporting.

19:55.346 --> 19:58.520
As of today, I have been reassigned
to my original unit.

19:58.604 --> 19:59.731
Thank you for your service.

19:59.814 --> 20:00.858
Good to have you back.

20:01.526 --> 20:02.778
And you are?

20:02.862 --> 20:06.620
Former maintenance officer
of the Seven Shining Stars, Yuri Sano.

20:06.703 --> 20:09.291
I wish to join the Black Knights!

20:10.376 --> 20:12.213
[all] Cheers!

20:12.923 --> 20:16.096
I'm glad Sano
was able to transfer to the Black Knights.

20:16.180 --> 20:19.562
No need for a resistance army
in a peaceful world like this.

20:19.646 --> 20:22.359
What do we even do now?

20:22.442 --> 20:23.862
Anything we want, I guess.

20:23.946 --> 20:28.412
Right! Well, let's kick things off
by getting sloshed today!

20:28.496 --> 20:30.458
I don't want to babysit you, so I'll pass.

20:30.959 --> 20:32.797
I'm underage, so I'll pass.

20:32.880 --> 20:34.341
Seriously?!

20:35.636 --> 20:36.763
[Kuroto] Shall we go?

20:36.846 --> 20:37.848
[Haruka] Yeah.

20:39.101 --> 20:41.355
What did you talk to your mother about?

20:41.438 --> 20:43.234
[Haruka] Hm? [chuckles]

20:43.401 --> 20:44.904
It's a secret, Dad.

20:45.488 --> 20:48.411
[Kuroto] What is it?
Found yourself a beau?

20:48.494 --> 20:51.333
[Haruka] Seriously... A beau?
No one talks like that anymore, Dad!

20:52.962 --> 20:54.381
[Kuroto] They don't?

20:55.968 --> 20:58.932
[female reporter] <i>Today, the first empress
of the new Special Autonomous Region,</i>

20:59.015 --> 21:00.602
<i>Sakuya Sumeragi me Britannia...</i>

21:00.686 --> 21:03.650
[male reporter] <i>Empress
Sakuya Sumeragi me Britannia's address</i>

21:03.734 --> 21:06.321
<i>will take place tonight at 7 p.m.</i>

21:14.589 --> 21:16.467
Sakuya Sumeragi, I command you.

21:16.968 --> 21:19.014
To seal the power of your Geass,

21:19.097 --> 21:22.270
you will never be able to speak again.

21:30.328 --> 21:32.625
[Sakuya] <i>This is my resolve.</i>

21:35.881 --> 21:38.052
Empress Sakuya, it's time.

21:39.471 --> 21:40.473
Understood.

21:41.141 --> 21:43.145
[crowd exclaim, cheer]

21:56.171 --> 21:58.175
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:27.813 --> 23:29.274
[♪ closing theme song ends]

23:32.238 --> 23:34.284
Would you like some coffee?

23:36.789 --> 23:40.004
They're inseparable from you, aren't they?

23:41.841 --> 23:44.847
You're like one big happy family.

23:44.930 --> 23:46.308
We are.

23:52.445 --> 23:54.533
[Sakuya] <i>An irreplaceable family</i>

23:55.159 --> 23:57.080
<i>that he left behind for me...</i>

24:01.631 --> 24:02.800
<i>We're all doing well,</i>

24:04.219 --> 24:05.221
<i>Ash.</i>
